    <div class="meta">\
      <span class="badge">v\{\{ post.data.version \}\}</span>\
      <span class="badge">\{\{ post.data.word_range \}\} words</span>\
      <span class="badge">\{\{ post.data.initial_status == "complete" ? "Published completed" : "Published unfinished" \}\}</span>\
      \{% if post.data.published_at %\}<span>Published: \{\{ post.data.published_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") \}\}</span>\{% endif %\}\
    </div>\
    \{% if post.data.release_notes and post.data.release_notes.length %\}\
      <p><strong>Latest:</strong> \{\{ post.data.release_notes[0] \}\}</p>\
    \{% endif %\}\
  </div>\
\{% else %\}\
  <p>No essays published yet.</p>\
\{% endfor %\}\
\
<hr>\
<h2>About</h2>\
<p><strong>DUE \'97 Deadline for Unfinished Essays</strong> publishes short essays under a 30-day deadline. Finished or not, they go live. Minor contributions are acknowledged; major contributions earn coauthorship. Essays evolve using semantic versioning.</p>\
